# Vain (Windurst 8-1, mission.windurst.vain), the Gustaberg zone-ins (North and South Gustaberg, Pashhow, Rolanberry).
# Status 1 (a GM): each zone-in plays its event, left open; its update sends the sky (0, 0, 0, 0, 0, n) the position or
# the zone before picks, or nothing; the finish closes it. A warp to 0,0,0 is 1,0,1 (a zone's onZoneIn sets a char at
# 0,0,0 down at its own spot); a warp inside a zone keeps the zone before it.
char zone=WindurstWaters pos=-55,-8,229 job=WAR lvl=75 nation=2
mission Asa BurgeoningDread current
mission Acp ACrystallineProphecyFin current
mission Rov ARhapsodyForTheAges current
mission Soa Abomination current
